<title>CROATIA: Croatia March PPI falls 0.7 pct, up 2.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatia March PPI falls 0.7 pct, up 2.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA PRODUCER PRICES	 MARCH     FEBRUARY   MARCH '96</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	    -0.7	  +0.1	 -1.0</p>
<p> Year-on-year			+2.2	  +2.0	 +0.7</p>
<p>NOTES -- January-March producer prices rose 0.3 percent from the end of 1996 and 2.0 percent from the same period last year.</p>
<p>Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly producer price inflation was running at 29.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
